WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:07.758
Terrell got onto a subway car with a group of other riders.

2
00:00:07.759 --> 00:00:10.510
He found a seat and put his backpack beside him.

3
00:00:10.511 --> 00:00:12.369
An old woman frowned at him.

4
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.066
"Shouldn't you be in school, young man?"

5
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:18.374
Terrell smiled. "I'm excused from school today.

6
00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:21.801
I'm competing in the All-City Science Fair downtown."

7
00:00:21.802 --> 00:00:23.414
He unzipped his backpack.

8
00:00:23.415 --> 00:00:26.732
Inside was a device covered in circuits and wires.

9
00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:31.071
"I invented a device that blocks electrical signals," he said.

10
00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:33.787
"Impressive," the woman said.

11
00:00:33.788 --> 00:00:35.479
But she was still frowning.

12
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.832
"You shouldn't be riding the train alone."

13
00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:41.883
"I'm getting off at the next station," Terrell said.

14
00:00:41.884 --> 00:00:43.886
"My parents said it was okay."

15
00:00:43.887 --> 00:00:46.391
"Hmpf!" the woman said.

16
00:00:46.392 --> 00:00:52.640
The subway train left the station.

17
00:00:52.641 --> 00:00:56.643
As it pulled into a dark tunnel, the lights went out.

18
00:00:56.644 --> 00:00:59.322
A moment later they flashed back on.

19
00:00:59.323 --> 00:01:01.794
Terrell gasped.

20
00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:04.724
A woman was hanging upside down from the ceiling!

21
00:01:04.725 --> 00:01:08.201
She wore a harness with eight mechanical legs attached.

22
00:01:08.202 --> 00:01:12.029
"I'm Black Spinneret!" the woman said.

23
00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:17.014
"I guess you people got into the wrong subway car today!"

24
00:01:17.015 --> 00:01:19.529
She reached out with one of her spider legs.

25
00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.569
Then she grabbed a man's phone.

26
00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:25.627
"Hey!" he yelled. "You stole my phone!"

27
00:01:25.628 --> 00:01:31.111
"Yep!" Black Spinneret laughed.

28
00:01:31.112 --> 00:01:35.107
She moved across the ceiling, stealing purses and other valuables.

29
00:01:35.108 --> 00:01:38.298
One of her long legs snagged Terrell's backpack.

30
00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:42.189
"My science project!" he said. "Please don't steal it!"

31
00:01:42.190 --> 00:01:45.128
Just then the subway train reached the next station.

32
00:01:45.129 --> 00:01:48.864
Holding Terrell's backpack, Black Spinneret darted through the door.

33
00:01:48.865 --> 00:01:55.109
Then she disappeared.

34
00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.898
Roxy and her friends were sitting in class.

35
00:01:57.899 --> 00:02:01.200
"I wish I was good at science," Jack said.

36
00:02:01.201 --> 00:02:03.902
"Then I could get out of school like Terrell."

37
00:02:03.903 --> 00:02:07.980
"Terrell's project is amazing," Mara said.

38
00:02:07.981 --> 00:02:10.816
"Do you think he'll win first prize?"

39
00:02:10.817 --> 00:02:13.244
"I hope so," Roxy said.

40
00:02:13.245 --> 00:02:16.875
"He worked really hard on building that device."

41
00:02:16.876 --> 00:02:20.978
Roxy's watch beeped.

42
00:02:20.979 --> 00:02:24.403
"Miss Apricot? May I go get a drink of water?"

43
00:02:24.404 --> 00:02:27.854
Miss Apricot nodded.

44
00:02:27.855 --> 00:02:32.071
In the hallway Roxy opened her watch.

45
00:02:32.072 --> 00:02:34.095
"What's up, Mayor Bloom?"

46
00:02:34.096 --> 00:02:36.453
"Rocket Girl!" Mayor Bloom said.

47
00:02:36.454 --> 00:02:40.681
"What has eight legs and just robbed people on a subway car?"

48
00:02:40.682 --> 00:02:43.910
"I don't know, Mayor," Roxy said.

49
00:02:43.911 --> 00:02:46.448
"Neither do I," Mayor Bloom said.

50
00:02:46.449 --> 00:02:48.495
"But I need you to find out."

51
00:02:48.496 --> 00:02:50.765
"Huh?" Roxy said.

52
00:02:50.766 --> 00:02:53.414
The mayor sighed.

53
00:02:53.415 --> 00:02:56.107
"There's a thief who moves like a spider.

54
00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:59.629
Metro City's subway system won't be safe until she's caught.

55
00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:02.935
I've shut down the subway until we find her."

56
00:03:02.936 --> 00:03:05.266
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

57
00:03:05.267 --> 00:03:09.915
"I'll track down that spider thief!"

